sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant API as ModelMeshApi<br/>8033/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS optional
    participant MM as SidecarModelMesh<br/>(ModelMesh core)
    participant etcd as etcd<br/>2379/TCP gRPC
    participant Peer as Peer ModelMesh Pod<br/>8080/TCP Thrift
    participant RT as Model Runtime<br/>8085/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,RT: Flow 1: Inference Request Routing

    Client->>API: gRPC inference request<br/>TLS + mTLS (optional)
    API->>MM: Route by model ID
    MM->>etcd: Lookup model location<br/>(instance table)
    etcd-->>MM: Model location info

    alt Model loaded locally
        MM->>RT: Forward inference<br/>gRPC :8085 or UDS<br/>No auth (localhost)
        RT-->>MM: Prediction result
    else Model on peer pod
        MM->>Peer: Forward request<br/>Thrift (litelinks) :8080<br/>TLS optional
        Note over Peer: Peer serves from<br/>its local runtime
        Peer-->>MM: Prediction result
    end

    MM-->>API: Response
    API-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Client,RT: Flow 2: Model Load/Unload Lifecycle

    Client->>API: registerModel RPC<br/>TLS + mTLS (optional)
    API->>MM: Register model
    MM->>etcd: Update model registry<br/>leader election check
    etcd-->>MM: Registry updated

    Note over MM: Leader selects<br/>target instance<br/>(LRU cache policy)

    MM->>etcd: Update instance table<br/>(assign model to pod)
    MM->>RT: loadModel RPC<br/>gRPC :8085 or UDS
    RT-->>MM: Model loaded / size info
    MM->>etcd: Update status<br/>(model LOADED)
    MM-->>API: Model registered
    API-->>Client: registerModel response
